  "Word generation data:": "词语生成数据：",
  " None. All word generation inputs and outputs are processed locally in your browser using JavaScript. No words, phrases, or user entries are transmitted to our servers or stored outside your device unless you choose to create an account.": " 没有。所有词语生成输入和输出都使用 JavaScript 在你的浏览器本地处理。除非你选择创建账户，否则任何词语、短语或用户输入都不会传输到我们的服务器，也不会存储在你的设备之外。",
  "Automatically collected data:": "自动收集的数据：",
  " Like most websites, our hosting infrastructure may automatically log standard server access data, including your IP address (truncated), browser type, referring URL, pages visited, and timestamps. This data is used solely for security monitoring and aggregate traffic analysis.": " 与大多数网站一样，我们的托管基础设施可能会自动记录标准服务器访问数据，包括你的 IP 地址（已截断）、浏览器类型、引荐 URL、访问页面和时间戳。这些数据仅用于安全监控和汇总流量分析。",
  "Contact form:": "联系表单：",
  " If you use our contact form, it opens your email client with pre-filled content. No data passes through our servers via the form itself.": " 如果你使用我们的联系表单，它会打开已预先填入内容的电子邮件客户端。表单本身不会让数据经过我们的服务器。",
  "We use automatically collected technical data to:": "我们使用自动收集的技术数据来：",
