  "You can opt out of personalised advertising at any time via Google Ads Settings, the Digital Advertising Alliance opt-out, or your browser's cookie settings.": "你可以随时通过 Google 广告设置、Digital Advertising Alliance 的退出选项或浏览器的 Cookie 设置，选择不接收个性化广告。",
  "We also store a single theme key in your browser's localStorage to remember your light/dark mode preference. This data never leaves your device.": "我们还会在你的浏览器 localStorage 中存储一个主题键，以记住你对浅色或深色模式的偏好。这些数据不会离开你的设备。",
  "We may use Google Analytics to understand aggregate usage of the Site. If enabled, Google Analytics collects anonymised data about pages visited, session duration, and device type. IP addresses are anonymised. You can opt out using the Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on.": "我们可能使用 Google Analytics 了解本网站的汇总使用情况。启用后，Google Analytics 会收集访问页面、会话时长和设备类型等匿名数据。IP 地址会被匿名化。你可以使用 Google Analytics 退出浏览器插件选择不参与。",
  "We implement reasonable technical measures to protect the Site from unauthorised access. Because word generation data is processed exclusively client-side and no personal word inputs are transmitted to us, the risk of a data breach affecting your generator inputs is zero by design.": "我们采取合理的技术措施保护本网站免受未经授权的访问。由于词语生成数据完全在客户端处理，个人词语输入不会传输给我们，因此从设计上说，影响你生成器输入的数据泄露风险为零。",
  "We cannot guarantee absolute security of data transmitted over the internet. Use the Site at your own risk in accordance with our Terms of Service.": "我们无法保证通过互联网传输的数据绝对安全。请根据我们的服务条款自行承担风险使用本网站。",
  "Lexigenz.com is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will take steps to delete it.": "Lexigenz.com 不面向 13 岁以下儿童。我们不会明知地收集儿童的个人信息。如果你认为儿童向我们提供了个人信息，请联系我们，我们会采取措施将其删除。",
  "Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights under applicable data protection law (including POPIA in South Africa and GDPR in the EU), including the right to access, correct, or delete personal data held about you.": "根据你所在的司法管辖区，你可能依据适用的数据保护法（包括南非的 POPIA 和欧盟的 GDPR）享有相关权利，包括访问、更正或删除我们持有的有关你的个人数据的权利。",
  "Because we collect minimal identifiable data, most requests can be addressed simply by clearing your browser's cookies and localStorage. For other requests, contact us at ": "由于我们收集的可识别数据极少，大多数请求只需清除浏览器的 Cookie 和 localStorage 即可处理。如有其他请求，请通过以下方式联系我们：",
  'We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the Site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Policy.': "我们可能会不时更新本隐私政策。变更将发布在本页面，并更新“最后更新”日期。变更后继续使用本网站，即表示你接受修订后的政策。",
  "For privacy-related questions or requests, contact us at ": "如有隐私相关问题或请求，请通过以下方式联系我们：",
  " or visit our ": "，或访问我们的",
