  "All rights, title, and interest in the Services remain exclusively owned by Lexigenz Trading or its licensors. Protected materials include software, databases, source code, designs, logos, trade names, trademarks, trade secrets, documentation, written content, audio and visual materials, algorithms, and business processes. No ownership rights are transferred to users through use of the Services.": "服务中的所有权利、所有权和权益均由 Lexigenz Trading 或其许可方专有。受保护的材料包括软件、数据库、源代码、设计、标识、商号、商标、商业秘密、文档、书面内容、音频和视觉材料、算法及业务流程。用户使用服务不会获得任何所有权。",
