  'To the maximum extent permitted by law, the Services are provided "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE." The Company disclaims all warranties, whether express, implied, statutory, or otherwise.': "在法律允许的最大范围内，服务按“现状”和“可用”基础提供。公司不承担任何明示、默示、法定或其他形式的保证责任。",
