  "Users agree to comply with all applicable privacy laws, consumer protection laws, anti-corruption laws, anti-money laundering laws, export control regulations, sanctions laws, and cybersecurity regulations.": "用户同意遵守所有适用的隐私法、消费者保护法、反腐败法、反洗钱法、出口管制法规、制裁法和网络安全法规。",
  "The Company shall not be liable for delays or failures caused by events beyond its reasonable control, including natural disasters, war, terrorism, civil unrest, government action, utility failures, telecommunications outages, cyberattacks, labour disputes, or pandemics.": "对于因公司合理控制范围之外的事件造成的延迟或故障，公司不承担责任，包括自然灾害、战争、恐怖主义、社会动荡、政府行为、公用事业故障、电信中断、网络攻击、劳资纠纷或疫情。",
  "The Company may immediately suspend or terminate access where these Terms are breached, fraud is suspected, security risks arise, or regulatory obligations require action. Termination shall not affect accrued rights, obligations, liabilities, or remedies.": "如违反本条款、怀疑存在欺诈、出现安全风险或监管义务要求采取行动，公司可以立即暂停或终止访问。终止不会影响已经产生的权利、义务、责任或救济。",
  "These Terms shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any dispute arising from these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of South Africa.": "本条款受南非共和国法律管辖并依其解释。因本条款产生的任何争议均应由南非法院专属管辖。",
  "Before commencing litigation, parties agree to attempt good-faith resolution through written notice of dispute, negotiation between authorized representatives, and mediation where appropriate. Nothing prevents either party from seeking urgent injunctive or equitable relief where necessary.": "在提起诉讼前，双方同意通过书面争议通知、授权代表之间的协商以及适当情况下的调解，善意尝试解决争议。必要时，任何一方均可寻求紧急禁令或衡平法救济。",
  "If any provision is deemed invalid, unlawful, or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.": "如果任何条款被认定为无效、违法或不可执行，其余条款仍完全有效。",
  "The Company reserves the right to amend these Terms at any time. Material changes will be communicated through appropriate channels. Continued use of the Services following publication of amended Terms constitutes acceptance of such changes.": "公司保留随时修改本条款的权利。重大变更将通过适当渠道通知。修订条款发布后继续使用服务，即表示接受这些变更。",
  "For legal notices, compliance inquiries, or questions relating to these Terms:": "如有法律通知、合规咨询或与本条款有关的问题：",
